-- title:
--   A canonical ordered-defect state
-- statement:
--   For $n\in\mathbb N$ and distinct indices $i,k\in[n]$ representing an empty and a full pair, define
--   $$S_{ik}=\{(a,0):a\in[n],\ a\ne i\}\cup\{(k,1)\}.$$
--   Pair $i$ is empty, pair $k$ has both labels, and every other pair has its label-zero element. This explicit representative uses no oracle or rank data.
